  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I'd rather have my 400-video playlist without using complicated trigger systems, but if I put 400 videos into a playlist, many players who join the world complain about lag for the first 5-10 minutes while the video player apparently loads every single video in the background. Players who don't get the extreme lag (like myself) still get a white screen until every single video is loaded.\n\nOne or two videos should be preloaded at most.",
